Package: datapipelines
Type: Project
Title: Extensible Data Pipeline Repository
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Repository", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainers@example.org")
Description: A repository-oriented framework for registering and running reusable
    data pipelines. The initial pipeline creates separate, comprehensive data
    dictionaries and metadata bundles from common statistical, spreadsheet, R, JSON, and
    Python-oriented data formats.
